{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "没收到的钱",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 56.66,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2022 年 1 月，Qubit 跨链桥出了事。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 1 月，Qubit 跨链桥出了事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 1.701,
   "speechEnd": 4.966
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "以太坊这一侧，没有收到对应的 ETH。",
   "spoken": "以太坊这一侧，没有收到对应的 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 5.42,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 5.513,
   "speechEnd": 8.417
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "BNB Chain 那一侧，却铸造出了代表 ETH 的 qXETH。",
   "spoken": "BNB Chain 那一侧，却铸造出了代表 ETH 的 qXETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 8.84,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 8.949,
   "speechEnd": 14.065
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "公开报道的损失，约 8000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "公开报道的损失，约 8000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 14.5,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 14.5,
   "speechEnd": 17.503
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "桥相信了一次外部调用的结果。",
   "spoken": "桥相信了一次外部掉用的结果。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 17.92,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 18.012,
   "speechEnd": 20.325
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 20.7,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 20.7,
   "speechEnd": 21.501
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "合约用低级 call，去调用一个没有代码的地址。",
   "spoken": "合约用低级 call，去掉用一个没有代码的地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 21.96,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 21.96,
   "speechEnd": 25.358
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "call 返回 true，还是 false？",
   "spoken": "call 返回 true，还是 false？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 25.78,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 25.877,
   "speechEnd": 27.648
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "答案是 true，而且返回数据是空的。",
   "spoken": "答案是 true，而且返回数据是空的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 28.36,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 28.36,
   "speechEnd": 31.228
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "EVM 不会因为目标没有代码，就让 call 失败。",
   "spoken": "EVM 不会因为目标没有代码，就让 call 失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 31.62,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 31.62,
   "speechEnd": 35.137
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "如果代码把成功加空返回，当成转账成功，",
   "spoken": "如果代码把成功加空返回，荡成转账成功，",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 35.6,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 35.695,
   "speechEnd": 40.284
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "它就会记下一笔，根本没有发生的转账。",
   "spoken": "它就会记下一笔，根本没有发生的转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 40.7,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 40.794,
   "speechEnd": 43.604
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "记住一句话：每一个外部调用，都是把命运交给别人。",
   "spoken": "记住一句话：每一个外部掉用，都是把命运交给别人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 44.04,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 44.04,
   "speechEnd": 49.313
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "对方可能失败，可能撒谎，可能拖延，也可能根本不存在。",
   "spoken": "对方可能失败，可能撒谎，可能拖延，也可能根本不存在。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg1-13.wav",
   "start": 49.78,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 49.88,
   "speechEnd": 55.221
  }
 ],
